@baseUrl = https://localhost:7260

### 1. Registro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### 3. Datos del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/manage/info
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4. Sin token (debe dar 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/manage/info

### 5. Refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}"
}

### 6. Crear enlace con código generado
# @name createLink
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://learn.microsoft.com/aspnet/core"
}

### 7. Crear enlace con alias y expiración
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://github.com",
  "alias": "mi-github",
  "expiresAt": "2027-12-31T23:59:59-05:00"
}

### 8. Errores de validación combinados (debe dar 400 con tres errores)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/links
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "javascript:alert(1)",
  "alias": "api",
  "expiresAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### 9. Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 10. Obtener por código
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 11. Actualizar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "destinationUrl": "https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet"
}

### 12. Desactivar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/links/{{createLink.response.body.$.code}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 13. Registro de un segundo usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### 14. Login del segundo usuario
# @name login2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "otro@ejemplo.com",
  "password": "Prueba123!"
}

### 15. El segundo usuario intenta ver el enlace del primero (debe dar 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/links/mi-github
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.$.accessToken}}

